   "source": [
    "df_clean = df_clean.drop(columns=['CRSDepTime','CRSArrTime','DepTime','ArrTime'], errors='ignore')\n",
    "# Reorganizar columnas: poner FlightDate primero, luego las nuevas datetime, luego el resto\n",
    "cols_base = list(df_clean.columns)\n",
    "fecha_col = 'FlightDate'  \n",
    "cols_new = ['sched_dep_dt','sched_arr_dt','dep_dt','arr_dt']\n",
    "ordered_cols = [fecha_col] + [c for c in cols_new if c in cols_base] + [c for c in cols_base if c not in ([fecha_col] + cols_new)]\n",
    "df_clean = df_clean[ordered_cols]\n",
    "df_clean.head()\n"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "c821a242",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "**Normalizacion de IATAs**\n",
    "\n",
    "La normalizacion se aplica a las columnas Origin, Dest, IATA_Code_Operating_Airline e IATA_Code_Marketing_Airline porque todas contienen codigos IATA que deben estar en un formato uniforme. \n",
    "\n",
    "El proceso convierte los valores a tipo string, elimina espacios en blanco, pasa todo a mayusculas y quita caracteres no alfabeticos. Esto asegura que los codigos de aeropuertos y aerolineas se comparen de forma consistente, evita duplicados por diferencias de formato y permite hacer merges y agrupaciones sin errores."
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": 12,
   "id": "d9886ab7",
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [
    {
     "name": "stdout",
     "output_type": "stream",
     "text": [
      "Valores unicos en Origin: ['GJT' 'HRL' 'DRO' 'IAH' 'DEN' 'TYS' 'MOB' 'LNK' 'BHM' 'IAD' 'ECP' 'AEX'\n",
      " 'LFT' 'BTR' 'ABQ' 'BUF' 'ALB' 'HSV' 'TUL' 'CPR']\n",
      "Valores unicos en Dest: ['DEN' 'IAH' 'GPT' 'TUL' 'LCH' 'AEX' 'MOB' 'CPR' 'OKC' 'GJT' 'DRO' 'SAF'\n",
      " 'SHV' 'MFE' 'DIK' 'HRL' 'BTR' 'HSV' 'ICT' 'SGF']\n",
      "Valores unicos en IATA_Code_Operating_Airline: ['C' 'G' 'ZW' 'YV' 'WN' 'YX' 'E' 'AA' 'PT' 'OO' 'AS' 'B' 'DL' 'F' 'HA'\n",
      " 'MQ' 'NK' 'OH' 'QX' 'UA']\n",
      "Valores unicos en IATA_Code_Marketing_Airline: ['UA' 'WN' 'AA' 'DL' 'AS' 'B' 'F' 'G' 'HA' 'NK']\n"
     ]
    }
   ],
   "source": [
    "# Normalizar codigos IATA de aeropuertos y aerolineas\n",
    "for c in ['Origin','Dest','IATA_Code_Operating_Airline','IATA_Code_Marketing_Airline']:\n",
    "    if c in df_clean.columns:\n",
    "        df_clean[c] = (\n",
    "            df_clean[c]\n",
    "            .astype(str)              \n",
    "            .str.strip()              \n",
    "            .str.upper()              \n",
    "            .str.replace(r'[^A-Z]', '', regex=True)\n",
    "        )\n",
    "\n",
    "# Comprobar ejemplos de valores unicos\n",
    "for c in ['Origin','Dest','IATA_Code_Operating_Airline','IATA_Code_Marketing_Airline']:\n",
    "    if c in df_clean.columns:\n",
    "        print(f\"Valores unicos en {c}:\", df_clean[c].unique()[:20])\n"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": 13,
   "id": "f4fa18d9",
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "for c in ['Cancelled','Diverted']:\n",
    "    if c in df_clean.columns:\n",
    "        df_clean[c] = df_clean[c].astype('bool').astype('int')"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
